  "name": "VisualRust",
  "description": "A comprehensive Visual Studio extension for Rust development, providing a custom MSBuild-based project system (.rsproj) and deep IDE integration. It implements syntax highlighting through an ANTLR4 lexer, integrates Racer for intelligent code completion, and supports GDB-based debugging within the Windows environment. The repository encompasses the full lifecycle of the extension, from language services and project templates to WiX-based installer configurations.",
